2026-11-01T00:00:04Z (RFD66606-2337) 'On the statue avatar's body, the scripted skirt's surface sits 12 to 17 mm inside the cone its rings are sized for, about an AA battery's width, between the front and back seams.
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2337  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:00:05Z (RFD66606-2337) 'Read the gates and controls below, then run the pen's check that no garment vertex is inside the body on the fitted skirt.
 # tags: rfd:exit
 Text:RFD2337  1 LINE
